      "rows": [
        [
          "",
          "最重要的句法问题：谁/什么（subject） + 做什么/是什么（predicate）？其余信息先暂时放旁边。"
        ]
      ],
      "text": " | 最重要的句法问题：谁/什么（subject） + 做什么/是什么（predicate）？其余信息先暂时放旁边。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2811
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        [
          "Pattern",
          "Plain meaning",
          "Example"
        ],
        [
          "S + V",
          "谁做动作",
          "Birds fly."
        ],
        [
          "S + V + O",
          "谁对什么做动作",
          "She opened the window."
        ],
        [
          "S + V + C",
          "谁处于什么状态",
          "The room became quiet."
        ],
        [
          "S + V + O + O",
          "给谁什么",
          "He gave me a book."
        ],
        [
          "S + V + O + C",
          "让宾语变成什么/做什么",
          "The news made us happy."
        ]
      ],
      "text": "Pattern | Plain meaning | Example\nS + V | 谁做动作 | Birds fly.\nS + V + O | 谁对什么做动作 | She opened the window.\nS + V + C | 谁处于什么状态 | The room became quiet.\nS + V + O + O | 给谁什么 | He gave me a book.\nS + V + O + C | 让宾语变成什么/做什么 | The news made us happy.",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2812
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "谓语识别快速法",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2813
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 真正谓语通常带时态：works / worked / is working / has finished / was built。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2814
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 一个简单句通常只有一个谓语中心；若出现第二个谓语，需要并列连词、从句连接词或另起一句。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2815
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· doing / done / to do 本身通常不能独立承担主句时态。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2816
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 长句找不到主干时：先划掉介词短语、非谓语短语和定语从句。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2817
    }
  ],
